                                                "sense_id": "5af51095-7d49-3dee-9de3-0655ad0fe296",
                                                "text": "It's a 58-minute journey with seven intermediate stops, including a reversal at Cromer - another popular destination. The train starts to empty at North Walsham, and then there is an exodus at Cromer. The coach is almost empty for the final few miles into Sheringham."
